00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:12.440 align:start position:0%
quantum particles such as electrons  carry a value of spin an intrinsic form  of angular momentum  particles can either have the value of  spin-up or spin-down  the name comes from an analogy that the  particle is spinning about its axis like  a planet but this comparison is wrong  and misleading the very notion that  electrons and protons are solid objects  that can rotate in space is difficult to  sustain given what we know about the  rules of quantum mechanics  the notion of stem came about after an  experiment in which a beam of electrons  were fed through a device which is able  to show the orientation of magnets if  you had placed a magnet in the device  and the North Pole of the magnet was  pointing up the magnet would be  deflected upwards by an amount  corresponding to how close to straight  up and down a head beam when electrons  went through the device  they were also deflected as if they were  tiny magnets but only to two locations  up or down by a certain distance those  that went up were said to have spin up  and those that went down who said to  have spin down  spen is an essential property  influencing the ordering of electrons  and nuclei in atoms many if not most  physical processes ranging from the  smallest nucleus scales to the largest  Astrophysical distances depend greatly  on interactions of subatomic particles  and the spins of those particles
 

